        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: About Schmidt, American Splendor\n- People: Alexander Payne, Michael Besman, Harry Gittes, Rachael Horovitz, Jim Taylor, Rolfe Kent, Jack Nicholson, Hope Davis\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Nicholson was born on April 22, 1937.\n- Jack Nicholson is an American actor and filmmaker who has performed for over 60 years.\n- About Schmidt is a 2002 American comedy-drama film.\n- About Schmidt was written and directed by Alexander Payne.\n- About Schmidt was produced by Michael Besman, Harry Gittes, and Rachael Horovitz.\n- Jim Taylor co-wrote About Schmidt.\n- Rolfe Kent composed the music for About Schmidt.\n- Jack Nicholson starred in About Schmidt in the title role.\n- Hope Davis starred in About Schmidt in 2002.\n- Hope Davis starred in American Splendor in 2003.",
